      "updatedAt": "2026-10-08T00:20:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d01-retention",
      "title": "Day 1: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "Baseline retrieval: after the main study, close everything and write 5 things you truly understood plus 3 questions you still have. This becomes your reference point.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-08T04:45:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-08T05:15:00Z",
      "durationMinutes": 30,
