    {
      "id": "precollege15-d02-retention",
      "title": "Day 2: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "1-day retrieval: before rereading, recall yesterday's topic for 5–10 min. Then repair gaps. Also do a short recall of today's new topic.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
