    {
      "id": "precollege15-d04-morning",
      "title": "Day 4: Morning start",
      "description": "Wake at 07:00. Water, wash up, and spend 10–15 min outdoors in daylight. Keep the phone away during this first block and do not open short-form feeds.\n\nBefore starting study, stand tall but relaxed for 20–30 sec: feet grounded, shoulders easy, chin gently back, no stiff 'military' posture.\n\n📖 Before today's exercise block: if any movement in the exercise task is unfamiliar, check EXERCISE_GUIDE.md (saved with this schedule) or search the YouTube phrase shown in [ ] inside the exercise description.\n\nThe aim is a steadier morning rhythm and clearer attention, not perfect posture.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-11T01:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-11T01:50:00Z",
      "durationMinutes": 20,
      "status": "scheduled",
      "priority": "medium",
