      "title": "Day 4: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "1-day retrieval of Day 3 plus quick recall of the Day 1–2 foundation. Explain at least one concept aloud without notes.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
