    {
      "id": "precollege15-d04-college-skill",
      "title": "Day 4: Canva / presentation skill",
      "description": "Canva: continue the course and practise adding/replacing images and editing text. Build 3 simple slides yourself instead of only watching. Course: https://www.canva.com/design-school/courses/canva-essentials/\nAt about 20 min, stand/walk for 60 sec and reset your shoulders/neck before continuing.",
