    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d07-learning",
      "title": "Day 7: Nursing/science learning",
      "description": "Retention day: retrieve Days 1–6 without rereading first. Draw your body map, define key terms, explain one system, and answer 5–10 mixed questions. Reopen sources only to repair gaps. Use https://openstax.org/books/anatomy-and-physiology-2e/pages/1-introduction and https://www.khanacademy.org/health-and-medicine/human-anatomy-and-physiology as references.\nMethod: use the 60-minute learning method from PreCollege_15_Day_Manual.md — learn a small amount, close the source, explain it, then answer questions.\nMovement rule: around the halfway point, stand for 60–90 sec, walk a little, look away from the screen/book, then resume. Do not stay frozen in one sitting posture for the whole hour.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-14T03:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-14T04:30:00Z",
      "durationMinutes": 60,
      "status": "scheduled",
      "priority": "medium",
      "tags": [
