      "updatedAt": "2026-10-08T00:20:00Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d07-retention",
      "title": "Day 7: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "7-day-style checkpoint: retrieve the most important ideas from Days 1–6 without opening notes. Mark each as understood, forgotten, confused, or recognition-only. Relearn only the weak points.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-14T04:45:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-14T05:15:00Z",
