    {
      "id": "precollege15-d07-college-skill",
      "title": "Day 7: Canva / presentation skill",
      "description": "Canva: use 'Creating impactful presentations' (https://www.canva.com/design-school/lessons/lesson-creating-impactful-presentations/). Focus on clear visual structure and slide storytelling. Then improve one of your earlier slides rather than making a new design from scratch.\nAt about 20 min, stand/walk for 60 sec and reset your shoulders/neck before continuing.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:10:00Z",
