    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d10-learning",
      "title": "Day 10: Nursing/science learning",
      "description": "Topic: respiratory system — airway, lungs and basic gas exchange. Use Khan's respiratory anatomy/physiology material: https://www.khanacademy.org/health-and-medicine/human-anatomy-and-physiology. Explain the path of air and the basic purpose of gas exchange.\nMethod: use the 60-minute learning method from PreCollege_15_Day_Manual.md — learn a small amount, close the source, explain it, then answer questions.\nMovement rule: around the halfway point, stand for 60–90 sec, walk a little, look away from the screen/book, then resume. Do not stay frozen in one sitting posture for the whole hour.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-17T03:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-17T04:30:00Z",
