    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d10-retention",
      "title": "Day 10: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "Cumulative retrieval: 10–15 min closed-book recall, then 5–10 mixed questions. Check only afterward.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
