    {
      "id": "precollege15-d10-college-skill",
      "title": "Day 10: Canva / presentation skill",
      "description": "Canva project: refine the 5-slide Nursing presentation. Check alignment, font consistency, slide density and image quality. Compare against the principles in https://www.canva.com/design-school/lessons/lesson-creating-impactful-presentations/.\nAt about 20 min, stand/walk for 60 sec and reset your shoulders/neck before continuing.",
