    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d13-learning",
      "title": "Day 13: Nursing/science learning",
      "description": "Topic: first-aid orientation from the INC B.Sc. Nursing mandatory module. Read the overview/learning outcomes and the principles of safety, seeking help, quick assessment, hygiene/handwashing. Do NOT practise clinical techniques on people. Source: https://www.indiannursingcouncil.org/uploads/pdf/17217301211821482221669f84495492a.pdf\nMethod: use the 60-minute learning method from PreCollege_15_Day_Manual.md — learn a small amount, close the source, explain it, then answer questions.\nMovement rule: around the halfway point, stand for 60–90 sec, walk a little, look away from the screen/book, then resume. Do not stay frozen in one sitting posture for the whole hour.",
      "startTime": "2026-10-20T03:30:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-10-20T04:30:00Z",
      "durationMinutes": 60,
      "status": "scheduled",
