    },
    {
      "id": "precollege15-d13-retention",
      "title": "Day 13: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "Cumulative recall before today's nursing-safety topic: body systems + circulation/respiration. Then check and repair the weak areas.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
