    {
      "id": "precollege15-d13-college-skill",
      "title": "Day 13: Canva / presentation skill",
      "description": "Canva: rebuild one slide from scratch without a template, using what you have learned. Then compare it with a template-based slide and decide which communicates better.\nAt about 20 min, stand/walk for 60 sec and reset your shoulders/neck before continuing.",
