      "title": "Day 14: Retrieval and retention",
      "description": "14-day-style checkpoint for the earliest material: retrieve it without notes. Then recall Days 8–13 in a mixed order. Revisit only failures.\nUse at least one 60-sec stand/walk break if you are doing the recall seated.",
